        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Voice Leading and Counterpoint",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "SATB harmonization is a constraint satisfaction problem (CSP). The variables are the four voice pitches at each time step. The constraints map directly:"
    },
    {
      "id": "05-VOICE-LEADING-COUNTERPOINT.md#012",
      "path": [
        "05-VOICE-LEADING-COUNTERPOINT.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:music-theory:05-voice-leading-counterpoint, git-history:music-theory:05-voice-leading-counterpoint]",
        "canonical_path": "music-theory/05-VOICE-LEADING-COUNTERPOINT.md",
        "concepts": "[voice, leading, counterpoint]",
        "current_path": "music-theory/05-VOICE-LEADING-COUNTERPOINT.md",
        "id": "maxim:music-theory:voice-leading-counterpoint",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "music-theory",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[voice, leading]",
        "section": "music-theory",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Voice Leading and Counterpoint",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "```\nCSP VARIABLE                     MUSICAL CONSTRAINT\n──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\nDomain per variable               Voice range (S: C₄–G₅, A: G₃–C₅, etc.)\nBinary constraint (adjacent       No parallel P5/P8 between any voice pair\n  time steps × voice pairs)\nUnary constraint on specific      Leading tone (7̂) must resolve up to 1̂\n  pitch-class assignments         Chordal 7th must resolve down by step\nConstraint on chord voicing       Double root (preferred), never double\n                                  leading tone\nArc consistency / propagation     If soprano = B (leading tone), then\n                                  soprano at t+1 ∈ {C} — prunes the tree\n```"
    },
    {
      "id": "05-VOICE-LEADING-COUNTERPOINT.md#013",
      "path": [
        "05-VOICE-LEADING-COUNTERPOINT.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:music-theory:05-voice-leading-counterpoint, git-history:music-theory:05-voice-leading-counterpoint]",
