        "section": "music-theory",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Voice Leading and Counterpoint",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "CHORDAL SEVENTH RULE: The 7th of a seventh chord must resolve DOWN by step\n  In G7 → C: the F (7th) resolves to E\n  The 7th is a \"prepared dissonance\" — it arrives by step or common tone,\n  and departs by step downward"
    },
    {
      "id": "05-VOICE-LEADING-COUNTERPOINT.md#023",
      "path": [
        "05-VOICE-LEADING-COUNTERPOINT.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:music-theory:05-voice-leading-counterpoint, git-history:music-theory:05-voice-leading-counterpoint]",
